==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*mehiläinen}}, from earlier *''meši'', from {{inh|fi|fiu-pro|*mekše}}, borrowed from {{der|fi|iir}}. Cognates include {{cog|et|mesilane}}, [[Erzya]] [[мекш#Erzya|''mekš'']].

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[bee]] {{gloss|flying insect of the clade Anthophila}}
#: {{coi|fi|'''mehiläis'''hoitaja|'''api'''culturist}}
#: {{coi|fi|'''mehiläisiä''' syövä|'''api'''vorous}}
# {{short for|fi|tarhamehiläinen||honey bee}}

